---

<BaseLayout title="Contact - Max Beatty" description="You can find me on these public profiles.">
  <SimpleLayout title="Contact" intro="You can find me on these public profiles.">
    <div class="prose max-w-2xl dark:prose-invert">
      <p>For professional introductions or questions about my work, <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/maxbeatty/">connect with Max Beatty on LinkedIn</a>. My background and project contributions are described on the <a href="/about/">about page</a> and <a href="/projects/">projects page</a>.</p>
      <p>For open source work, visit <a href="https://github.com/maxbeatty">my GitHub profile</a>. Questions or bug reports about a particular project belong in that project’s issue tracker, where its maintainers and other users can follow the discussion. The source for this website is available in the <a href="https://github.com/maxbeatty/blog">blog repository</a>.</p>
      <p>You can also follow <a href="https://x.com/maxbeatty">@maxbeatty on X</a>. This is my personal website; for support with products mentioned in my writing, please use the product’s official support channels.</p>
    </div>
  </SimpleLayout>
</BaseLayout>
